# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets parses this file and applies the rules to
# asset responses. It is NOT served as an asset itself.
#
# These override what Workers sends by default, which for every static asset
# is "Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate".

# Vite/Astro emit content-hashed filenames, so these can never change in
# place. Long-lived + immutable means a returning visitor revalidates nothing.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
